_DA = [("Gardo", "Pare, nakahanap ka na ba ng trabaho?", "Pal, have you found a job yet?"), ("Simon", "Oo, dun sa karinderya ni Aling Tisay, tagaluto, tagahugas ng plato, at tagalinis na rin.", "Yes, at Aling Tisay’s carinderia, cook, dishwasher, and also cleaner."), ("Gardo", "Okey na ’yun. Kaysa naman habambuhay kang tambay.", "That’s okay. Better than being a layabout for life."), ("Simon", "Oo nga. At saka nagawa ko na rin ’ata lahat, magbobote, magbabalut, magbubulaklak, maglalako ng kung anu-ano. Ewan, wala namang nangyari. Kahit papano, dito sa karinderya, sigurado ang sahod ko at libre pa ang pagkain. Ikaw, kumusta?", "Right. And I think I have also done everything, selling bottles, selling balut, selling flowers, peddling all sorts of things. I don’t know, nothing came of it. At least, here at the carinderia my pay is sure and the food is even free. How about you?"), ("Gardo", "Eto, Ka-e-endo ko lang. Habang naghihintay ng trabaho, nasa bahay muna, tagahatid-sundo ng mga bata, tagalaba, tagasingil ng konting pautang ni Misis, at tagabili ng itinitinda sa maliit naming tindahan.", "Here, I have just been ended. While waiting for work, I’m at home for now, taking the children to and from school, doing the laundry, collecting a few debts from the small lending business of my wife, and buying the goods sold in our little store.")]
